==Strategy==
Quite a lot of Doge Darks spawn, so do not underestimate this stage if you challenge it very early on. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] can be a good tank, while [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can take care of much of the damage. Use combos to boost base health if nothing else works.

